silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_05_biologist_entry_point_concrete_anchor_2#itisrecord_183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The ITISRecord_183798 is the ITIS TSN 183798 record: Felis catus authority entry, valid_name = Felis catus, rank = species, parent = Felis (TSN 180586). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ITISRecord_183798', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
